        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "text",
          "content": "    1 0 1 0 1 0 1 0     (170)\n  + 1 0 1 1 1 0 0 1     (185)\n  -----------------\n  1 0 1 1 0 0 0 1 1     → 9 bits: the 9th bit is an OVERFLOW",
          "caption": "10101010 + 10111001 in 8 bits"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "The 8-bit result is **01100011** (99) — wrong, because 170 + 185 = 355 > 255. This is **overflow**."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
